# Reflecting Pool (Basic-Slot-Pool)

Stake cluster-cascade slot on Suki Engine. Minimize scope and tokens on every task.

## Agent discipline (token savings)

- Do **not** explore the repo broadly unless the task requires it. Open only files named below or `@`-mentioned by the user.
- Prefer **one-file or few-file diffs**. No drive-by refactors, docs, or tests unless asked.
- Do **not** relaunch the dev server or run publish unless the user asks.
- Read **small slices** of large files (`board.js`, `game.js`) via offset/limit — not whole files.
- Answer review questions **without editing**. Implement only when the user wants changes.
- If context is missing, ask **one** narrow question — do not re-derive the whole architecture.

## Dev

- Start: `npm start` → `http://127.0.0.1:5176`
- Desktop dev: `?dev=true&screen=desktop&sessionID=local-demo&rgs_url=http://127.0.0.1:5176`
- Publish: `npm run frontend:publish` → upload `dist/` to Stake ACP

