## Layout constants (`board.js`)

- `SYMBOL_CONTAINER_SCALE = 0.9` — reels scaled (not mask-clipped)
- `CABINET_BG_VISUAL_SCALE = 1.16` — clamped per breakpoint in `cabinetBgFitScale()`
- `BOARD_LAYOUT_SCALE = 1.3` — full canvas fit vs legacy 0.92 margin
- Inner pad ~17% cell height (desktop), ~15% popout-s
- HTML ledger: `--cabinet-top-offset` / `--cabinet-height` on `.suki-game-core`

## Breakpoints (Stake `data-suki-screen`)

- Desktop UI: `desktop`, `laptop`, `popout-l`, `popout-s`
- Mobile UI: `mobile-l`, `mobile-m`, `mobile-s`
- Popout-s: no side ledger; compact layout

## Recent layout decisions (do not revert without asking)

- Cabinet bg bleed is **mask-only** on mobile; **fit-clamped** so art stays on canvas
- Laptop / popout-l: ~5% layout slack for bg (`layoutCabinetBgSlackPx`)
- Board inner stroke removed (`drawFrame` clears only)
- Do **not** re-reserve full bg bleed in layout fit (shrinks reel grid)

## Commits / PRs

- Commit only when the user asks
- Use `gh` for GitHub; do not push unless asked
